# What `gcloud run deploy --source api` must NOT upload to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file gcloud uploads everything in api/, including files that are
# gitignored but still sitting on disk. The build tarball is kept in a GCS
# bucket in the project, so anything listed here would otherwise outlive the
# build. The running image is unaffected either way -- the scratch stage in the
# Dockerfile copies only the compiled binary.

# Real production session cookies, and a local scratch database.
prod-cookies.txt
cookies.txt
app.db

# Tests never run in the image build; go build only needs the main package.
*_test.go
